      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm pretty certain I mentioned in another thread that this could be implemented relatively easily by adding an instance description field. As has been mentioned, you see 12 people in a world, 2 of your friends are there but until you enter you don't realize they are having a meeting. Even after joining you still don't know the topic. People end up hopping in and out because there is no other mechanism available.",
